





  ╭─ Install simstim-host on raspberry? ─────────────────────── step 3 of 4 ─╮
  │                                                                          │
  │  simstim needs a small helper on the host to keep sessions alive.        │
  │                                                                          │
  │    What    simstim-host 0.1.0-test, about 9 MB, SHA-256 checked          │
  │    Where   ~/.local/share/simstim/bin/0.1.0-test/                        │
  │    Also    turn on linger, install this terminal's terminfo              │
  │                                                                          │
  │  Nothing listens on the network, and nothing runs until you start a      │
  │  session.                                                                │
  │                                                                          │
  ╰─ enter install · esc back ───────────────────────────────────────────────╯






